            doc/scripts/TGScriptSkeleton
         </remove>
         <description>
            <p>
                The repository provides a set of improved Pixinsight scripts from various authors as well as some newly written scripts.
            </p>
            <p>
               Updates:
               <br/>
               Astro Bucket List 0.27.1 expands collection management with list merging, deduplication, multiple list memberships, checked-object transfers and direct selection export. Planning gains broadband/narrowband classification, relative month filtering and three-level sorting. Finder and DSS previews update automatically with persistent configuration and expanded chart details. Compact collapsible controls, improved save handling and updated PiDoc documentation complete this release.
            </p>
            <p>
               Copyright (c) 2026 Dr. Thorsten Glebe. All Rights Reserved.
            </p>
         </description>
      </package>
   </platform>
